5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:25,766
My wife was a member of the Knesset two years,

6
00:00:25,766 --> 00:00:28,266
three years, ago four years ago.

7
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,933
we right in the middle of the political.

8
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:35,433
And we want to live in peace.

9
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:36,900
We want to live peacefully.

10
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:41,333
I told you there will be no peace in my generation,

11
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:43,833
but we want to live peacefully,

12
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:48,000
and I thought the things that we are doing,

13
00:00:48,266 --> 00:00:53,066
the things that we are talking about them all the time,

14
00:00:54,600 --> 00:01:00,633
would get into the mind of the majority of people in

15
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:02,566
in Gaza.

16
00:01:03,666 --> 00:01:08,333
And when I saw all the pictures, that civilians,

17
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,866
not Nukhba, not the soldiers,

18
00:01:10,866 --> 00:01:13,833
but the civilians coming to

19
00:01:13,833 --> 00:01:16,533
