in the in the refrigerator.

24
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:32,133
Of course it's disappointing.

25
00:01:32,433 --> 00:01:33,866
Very disappointing.

26
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,966
I thought that we can talk.

27
