I want to live good here.

30
00:01:45,066 --> 00:01:49,066
I don't care about them but I know that,

31
00:01:49,566 --> 00:01:51,233
as I told you before,

32
00:01:51,233 --> 00:01:53,000
if I want to live good here,

33
00:01:53,133 --> 00:01:55,033
